          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha kutanga omukono gwe ku mutwe gwayo, era anaagiitiranga agho emberi w'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. Agho bakabona ab'oku lulyo lwa Aaroni banaamansiranga omusaayi gwayo ku ndhuyi dhoonadhoona edh'alutaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
