          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ensigo dhombi ghalala n'amasavu agadhiriku, n'ekitundu ekisinga obulungi ku ini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaayokeranga ebyo byonabyona ku alutaari ng'ekigheebwayo eky'eby'okulya ekyokebwa, olw'akawoowo kaakyo akasangaaza Musengwa Katonda. Amasavu goonagoona ga Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalyanga ku masavu oba ku musaayi; eryo n'erinaabanga eiteeka ery'olubeerera, lye munaakuumanga buli ghe munaabanga enaku dhoonadhoona.”",
          "type": "text",
